    "detailed_description": "<h1>COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Swords and Hexes&quot; is a top-down strategy-RPG adventure, with a wacky twist on old-school fantasy. Before you stands an unlikely hero's journey, you, a humble servant to the not-so-humble Prince Charles, will find yourself in quite a pickle while running errands for him, for he is the chosen one who will crush the dark forces that loom. For there is a legendary prophecy that states, &quot;One who can assemble all the scattered pieces of the Hex of Power will be blessed with god-like powers. I can think of no other, more capable, than our beloved Prince Charles of Hexagonia, for only . . .\u00a0 start with pre-heating your cauldron to a seven log strong scorching fire, toss in all of the ingredients, then stir violently until everything is burnt to a crisp. (If all fails, order gnome-dash) . . . and only then will the balance be restored.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore and frolic through the enchanting open world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect shoddy and peculiar items through various Do-abouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Converse with your co-servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Combat your enemies through careful turn-based strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subscribe To The Latest -Mana-Tier- by Wishlisting This Game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/extras/6c71cc3641d1822613e5279342ec314f.avif?t=1748466988\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Swords and Hexes&quot; is a top-down strategy-RPG adventure, with a wacky twist on old-school fantasy. Before you stands an unlikely hero's journey, you, a humble servant to the not-so-humble Prince Charles, will find yourself in quite a pickle while running errands for him, for he is the chosen one who will crush the dark forces that loom. For there is a legendary prophecy that states, &quot;One who can assemble all the scattered pieces of the Hex of Power will be blessed with god-like powers. I can think of no other, more capable, than our beloved Prince Charles of Hexagonia, for only . . .\u00a0 start with pre-heating your cauldron to a seven log strong scorching fire, toss in all of the ingredients, then stir violently until everything is burnt to a crisp. (If all fails, order gnome-dash) . . . and only then will the balance be restored.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore and frolic through the enchanting open world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect shoddy and peculiar items through various Do-abouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Converse with your co-servants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Combat your enemies through careful turn-based strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subscribe To The Latest -Mana-Tier- by Wishlisting This Game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/extras/6c71cc3641d1822613e5279342ec314f.avif?t=1748466988\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
